abstract: >
  A refined concentration inequality for sums of independent bounded random
  variables based on the sharp two-point moment-generating-function bound,
  with an explicit improvement over Hoeffding's inequality and reproducible
  numerical verification. Classified as an incremental/expository refinement
  of classical material (Hoeffding 1963); not a new fundamental inequality.
